text = "This is my Fourth Touhou fan game. This time, I'll be aiming more towards the headpat mechanic. Learning from the mistakes I made from last game, I changed my way of detecting the mouse, and it works like a charm now.

This game is heavily inspired from \"Neko Rumia Nare-Nare\" game which was released for the Touhou Station Jam. It is a game where you pet Rumia to play.

There used to be a mechanic where you can flick Cirno's forehead, and get a bad end. But, I decided to remove that idea because I feel sorry for her...

P.S. Try Pressing the magic number on the keyboard within the first nine seconds of the game.

- FerdysLab"
align = 3
autowrap = true

